        "id": "ana",
        "name": "Ana"
      }
    ],
    "explanation": "Leoric struggles against high-mobility Heroes (such as Tracer) who can simply dodge Entomb and/or disconnect his Drain Hope (like Samuro using Mirror Image or Image Transmission).\n\nDue to having self-healing in his kit, Leoric does not like to face Heroes who have access to healing reduction Abilities (for example Biotic Grenade by Ana)."
