    "explanation": "Leoric is a strong pick on Maps where the game lasts long enough to reach Level 20 and unlock Buried Alive and/or where double soaking is strong (notably Towers of Doom where you can count on both).\n\nAdditionally, Leoric is a good pick on Maps where your team requires a solid Offlaner with good self-sustain and waveclear."
